# Hosts to decommission, one per line.
#
# Adding a host here and running `hdfs dfsadmin -refreshNodes` starts an ORDERLY
# decommission: the NameNode re-replicates that node's blocks elsewhere first and
# only then reports it as Decommissioned. Watch progress with
# `hdfs dfsadmin -report` and never power the machine off before the state
# actually flips — pulling it early turns a planned removal into data at risk.
#
# Empty during normal operation.
